<title>USA: TABLE - Donaldson Lufkin Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Donaldson Lufkin Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.54		    $1.53</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.49		     1.53</p>
<p> Net			100,200		   97,000</p>
